{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting as a tiny frog egg, the gameplay is from a third-person perspective and includes playing an exploration game as a frog, where you start as a tadpole, explore different areas, chase food, find safe homes to capture, avoid enemies and dangers, and eventually gather other frogs to complete the life cycle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYABLE FEATURES OF MARKERBOARD JUNGLE: FROGS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration game as a <strong>Frog</strong>. Start as a tadpole, explore the area, chase food, find safe homes to capture, avoid enemies and dangers, and eventually gather other frogs to complete the life cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frog Food</strong>: Beetles, Crickets, Houseflys, and Slugs are currently on the menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong>: Sunfish, Sierra Newt, Fence Lizard, Bald Eaglet, Car Tire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frog Facts</strong> and <strong>Tadpole Trivia</strong> to read as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Journal</strong> of frog types from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth Mode</strong> which lets you change and view accurate settings about the Earth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1014200?t=1772235943","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772235943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014200/56b7d6b8563c597c0f8055cbc22812943ae75ba1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772235943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014200/56b7d6b8563c597c0f8055cbc22812943ae75ba1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772235943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full 